<title>USA: ASARCO Inc Q1 profits rose.</title>
<headline>ASARCO Inc Q1 profits rose.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Call Q1 consensus estimate was $0.80 per share.</p>
<p>				 (in millions, except per share data)</p>
<p>							   1997	  1996</p>
<p> Sales					  $     715.6 $     735.0</p>
<p>Earnings before taxes and</p>
<p>   minority interests				94.4	  93.2</p>
<p> Taxes on income				     26.6	  32.9</p>
<p> Earnings before minority interests	    67.8	  60.3</p>
<p> Minority interests				(27.2)	(24.6)</p>
<p> Net earnings					  40.6	  35.7</p>
<p> Average common shares outstanding	     42.9	  42.6</p>
<p> Net earnings per share			    0.95	  0.84</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 net includes $7.2 million gain on sale of mining stake.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
